# BuildKit uses <dockerfile-path>.dockerignore (this file) IN PLACE OF the repo-root .dockerignore
# when the image is built with `-f mayhem/Dockerfile`. The upstream root .dockerignore excludes
# .git/ and .github/ (it targets the project's own slim image); our commit image must BAKE IN the
# FULL repo incl. .git history (the grader uses it). This additive override does that — it never
# modifies the upstream-tracked .dockerignore (keeps the mayhem layer a clean additive replay).
#
# Drop only local build artifacts and editor/OS cruft; keep .git and source.

# ── Build outputs / local cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────
build*/
out/
mayhem-build/
mayhem-build-standalone_main.o
mayhem-tests/
install_dir/
.cache/
compile_commands.json
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
**/__pycache__/

# ── Editor / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
